        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 839,  1.25 Inch Diameter French Twist Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe French Twist Cabinet Knob is a timeless design that will always be a classic in luxury homes. This beautiful kitchen cabinet knob is elegant no matter which of the available finish color options you choose. Made by MNG Hardware, the 1.25 Inch Diameter French Twist Knob is beloved for its effortless style. Each knob comes packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+French+Twist\">MNG French Twist Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 839 French Twist Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
